libklvanc
------------------------------------------
Libklvanc is a library which can be used for parsing/generation of Vertical
Ancillary Data (VANC) commonly found in the Serial Digital Interface (SDI)
wire protocol.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libklvanc-devel-1.7.0-1bl1
  libklvanc0-1.7.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/stoth68000/libklvanc

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/stoth68000/libklvanc/archive/refs/tags/vid.obe.1.7.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libklvanc-1.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libklvanc-1.7.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libklvanc-1.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libklvanc-1.7.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libklvanc0-1.7.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libklvanc-devel-1.7.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

